The sentences in this folder, with their words, readings and part-of-speech tags, come
from the Hong Kong Cantonese Corpus and are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Credit: K. K. Luke and May L. Y. Wong (2015), "The Hong Kong Cantonese Corpus: Design and
Uses", Journal of Chinese Linguistics. Source: https://github.com/fcbond/hkcancor

The `english` field is a machine translation added by this repository, and is covered by
its license, CC BY-SA 4.0 (see ../README.md).

Changes: readings (and, for HKCanCor, the English) may have been corrected in this
repository; each line's git history shows what changed. See ../README.md, "Changes made here".
